WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.730
Hi, I'm Plinth!

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:06.810
Let's follow one turn through Tencent's Hy Memory, and a model trained

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:08.170
only to write memories.

00:00:09.683 --> 00:00:12.793
A reader cannot recover a fact that was never stored.

00:00:12.793 --> 00:00:15.281
The writer decides what later answers can use.

00:00:19.258 --> 00:00:20.518
A new turn arrives.

00:00:20.518 --> 00:00:24.297
The first model call extracts durable facts and drops the small talk.

00:00:24.717 --> 00:00:26.972
Each fact is searched against stored facts.

00:00:26.972 --> 00:00:30.837
Only matches above a fused score of zero point four go forward.

00:00:31.257 --> 00:00:35.076
The second call reconciles them: add, merge, or supersede a fact that

00:00:35.076 --> 00:00:36.348
is no longer true.

00:00:36.768 --> 00:00:38.406
The bank applies the operations.

00:00:38.406 --> 00:00:41.682
Recall needs no model, just an embedding and a search.

00:00:43.483 --> 00:00:44.234
Three moves.

00:00:45.239 --> 00:00:46.405
Add, for something new.

00:00:47.281 --> 00:00:49.774
Update, to merge a detail into the same fact.

00:00:50.194 --> 00:00:52.155
Supersede, when both cannot be true.

00:00:52.155 --> 00:00:54.116
The old fact stays as history.

00:00:55.508 --> 00:01:00.028
In the engine's own diagram, the write row is embed, extraction, then reconcile.

00:01:00.448 --> 00:01:04.147
The search row is recall, fusion, and a response in three channels.

00:01:05.883 --> 00:01:09.308
One extraction call read about two and a half thousand tokens to

00:01:09.308 --> 00:01:10.450
write about a hundred.

00:01:12.233 --> 00:01:15.380
Training scores each chunk of writes by what the bank can answer.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:19.345
Probes check that facts survived, and traps check that filler stayed out.

00:01:19.765 --> 00:01:23.167
Outcome credit comes from later questions, traced back to this chunk.

00:01:23.587 --> 00:01:25.796
A growth penalty stops it storing everything.

00:01:27.758 --> 00:01:32.574
It leads Claude Opus 5 everywhere, but two margins are hundredths of a point.

00:01:32.574 --> 00:01:34.294
Without travel planning, Opus leads.

00:01:35.933 --> 00:01:39.011
The writer can only reconcile what retrieval hands it.

00:01:39.011 --> 00:01:41.063
A contradiction the search misses stays.

00:01:42.858 --> 00:01:44.137
Extract, search, reconcile, store.

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:46.376
And read the tie as a tie.

00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:49.438
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:49.438 --> 00:01:50.004
I'm Plinth.

00:01:50.004 --> 00:01:50.287
Bye!
